// di76-png - by Dwight Ivany
// di76 with the TUKAN "Classic" interface - the PNG-based GUI of the
// tk_gui_tools library (GUI mode 0 of the BL-1C sample): framed knob images,
// a ZenoMOD-style needle VU for gain reduction, blue faceplate.
// The audio code and the slider block are identical to di76.jsfx (same DSP,
// same slots 1,5,9,13,17,21 with "-reserved" spacers), so saved sessions and
// slider values are interchangeable between di76, di76-tuk and di76-png.
// GUI library: tk_gui_tools.jsfx-inc by Tukan_Studios - "free as in free
// beer", may be used, modified and shared for JSFX plugins; parts of the
// VU-meter code with friendly permission from ZenoMOD (chris-s, ZenoMOD).
//   https://stash.reaper.fm/v/53055/tk-gui-tools.zip
// The classic layout is adapted from the "Blue One Compressor BL-1C" example
// (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 JClones / Tukan):
//   https://github.com/TukanStudios/TUKAN_STUDIOS_PLUGINS
// PNG files required next to this plugin (from the library zip):
//   HexKnob.png (101 stacked knob frames), Transtparent_Black_VU.png (VU dial),
//   VU_Shadow.png, Glow_VU.png (VU dressing)
// DSP origin/credits: see di76.jsfx (Stillwell 1175, BSD, retained below).

